#: assets/js/api.js:333
msgid ""
"The 'Browser-based/Single Page app', also known as 'Implicit Code Grant', is "
"similar to the 'Web-server App' with two distinct differences"
msgstr ""
"「Browser-based/Single Page app」（又稱「Implicit Code Grant」）與「Web-server App」類似，但有兩個明顯差異"

#: assets/js/api.js:337
msgid ""
"The 'Web-server App', also known as 'Authorization Code Grant', should be "
"very familiar if you’ve ever signed into a web app using your Facebook or "
"Google account"
msgstr ""
"「Web-server App」（又稱「Authorization Code Grant」）對您來說應該相當熟悉，只要您曾使用 Facebook 或 Google 帳戶登入過網頁應用程式"

#: Api.class.php:136
msgid "The API Key Regeneration Notification."
msgstr "API 金鑰重新產生通知"

#: api.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"The API module allows administrators to configure and manage FreePBX "
"remotely through automated. As an administrator you can use other languages "
"to control your PBX systems."
msgstr "API 模組可讓管理員透過自動化方式遠端設定與管理 FreePBX。身為管理員，您可以使用其他程式語言來控制您的 PBX 系統。"

#: Api.class.php:136
msgid ""
"The API private key has been regenerated due to a detected security risk "
"involving encryption keys. Please ensure your API integration operates as "
"expected and regenerate your tokens if necessary."
msgstr "由於偵測到涉及加密金鑰的安全性風險， API 私密金鑰已重新產生。請確認您的 API 整合運作如常，並在必要時重新產生您的權杖。"

#: views/system/modals.php:37
#: views/user/modals.php:37
msgid ""
"The redirect uri specifies where we redirect users after they have chosen "
"whether or not to authenticate your application"
msgstr "重新導向 URI 會指定我們在使用者選擇是否授權您的應用程式後，將使用者重新導向至何處"

#: views/system/accessTokenGrid.php:1
#: views/system/refreshTokenGrid.php:1
msgid ""
"The tokens listed below are encrypted and therefore you can not copy them "
"below and expect to use them in your application. You can only use the "
"token(s) that are presented to you in your application. This is a security "
"mechanisim so that someone can't steal your credentials by just looking at "
"this page"
msgstr ""
"下方列出的權杖已加密，因此您無法將它們複製到應用程式中使用。您只能使用應用程式呈現給您的權杖。這是一種安全機制，防止他人僅靠檢視此頁面即可竊取您的憑證"

#: views/authorize.php:35
msgid "This application is requesting being able to:"
msgstr "此應用程式要求取得下列權限："

